# Sink kind: azure_table_storage
#
# Writes Herald log events as entities into an Azure Table Storage
# table. Configurable partition strategy (UtcDay / UtcHour /
# UtcMinute / Fixed) trades query locality for write throughput.
# Auth via connection string OR DefaultAzureCredential (managed
# identity in production) OR a caller-built TableClient.

